      "message": "[warning] Line 374: 🟡 `setImage(_:)` updates the bitmap but does not reset `zoomScale`/`contentOffset` when the displayed media changes. If this `UIViewRepresentable` instance is reused for another image, the next image can inherit the previous zoom/pan state and open already zoomed/cropped. Reset zoom/offset when a new image is assigned (e.g., set `zoomScale \u003d minimumZoomScale`, `contentOffset \u003d .zero`, then refit/center) so each media item starts from a consistent baseline.",
